<title>POLAND: EXBUD MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 1.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>EXBUD MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 1.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.55 vs   0.46</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.16 vs   0.22</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.99 vs   0.34</p>
<p> Sales		   23.39 vs  19.19</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.13 vs   1.73</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.58 vs   1.98</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.84 vs   1.66</p>
<p> Sales		   57.67 vs  52.46</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is Exbud</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
